-- live grid ever exposed for a Class-F row — see dashboard.ts's
-- isRetirementContributionRow() comment for the phantom-balance mechanism
-- this corrects). frequency = the source row's own saved
-- contribution_frequency (real stored data, not assumed — every one of
-- the 45 affected rows in DEV has contribution_frequency = 'monthly').
-- contributor = 'spouse' only for spouse_contribution rows, 'self'
-- otherwise, per Chunk 3a's "who contributes to whose account" model.
